Login kar lo.

Top-right me + icon par click karo.
New repository select karo.
Repository name:
Description (optional):
Public ya Private select karo.
README initialize mat karna (unchecked rakho).
Create repository par click karo.

Repository create hone ke baad URL milega:
https://github.com/YourUserName/EMS.git
Is URL ko copy kar lo.

Git Initialize Karo
git init

Git Status Check Karo
git status

Files Stage Karo
git add .

git status
Ab files green color me dikhengi.

First Commit Karo
git commit -m "Initial EMS project setup"

GitHub Repository Connect Karo

YourUserName ki jagah apna GitHub username lagao.
git remote add origin https://github.com/YourUserName/EMS.git

git remote -v
Output:
origin  https://github.com/YourUserName/EMS.git (fetch)
origin  https://github.com/YourUserName/EMS.git (push)

Main Branch Set Karo
git branch -M main

Push Karo
git push -u origin main

Future Updates
Jab bhi code change karo:

git add .
git commit -m "Added login page"
git push